  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Horticulture support Gagauzia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The vegetable sector is still underdeveloped in Moldova. Introducing and expanding protected vegetable production technologies could enable a longer growing season and increased yields. This project will contribute to developing the protected vegetable sector in the autonomous region of Gagauzia. Project interventions include (i)	organising a feasibility study to advise on protected vegetable production;(ii)	a seminar to share results; and (iii)	a half-day training and demonstration session.</narrative>
  </description>
